sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Administrator
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant OLM as OLM<br/>(OCP only)
    participant CatalogSrc as Catalog Sources<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Registry as Container Registries<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant CertMgr as cert-manager
    participant HookJob as Helm Hook Jobs<br/>(XKS only)
    participant GatewayAPI as Gateway API
    participant Authorino as Authorino<br/>(Kuadrant/RHCL)

    rect rgb(220, 240, 255)
        Note over Admin,Registry: Flow 1: Kustomize Deployment (OCP)
        Admin->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply -k<br/>Auth: kubeconfig
        K8sAPI->>OLM: Process Subscriptions
        OLM->>CatalogSrc: Resolve operator versions<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.2+
        OLM->>Registry: Pull operator images<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: Pull secret
        Note over OLM: Operators start and register CRDs
        Admin->>K8sAPI: Apply configurations/<br/>(post-CRD custom resources)
    end

    rect rgb(220, 255, 220)
        Note over Admin,Authorino: Flow 2: Helm XKS Deployment (non-OCP)
        Admin->>K8sAPI: helm install<br/>Auth: kubeconfig
        K8sAPI-->>Admin: Release created
        Note over HookJob: Post-install hooks execute
        HookJob->>K8sAPI: Create RHAI Operator<br/>Deployment + CRDs + RBAC<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        HookJob->>CertMgr: Create CA Issuer<br/>+ Certificate CRs
        CertMgr-->>HookJob: TLS certs provisioned
        HookJob->>GatewayAPI: Create inference-gateway<br/>+ maas-default-gateway<br/>Auth: RBAC
        HookJob->>K8sAPI: Create DataScienceCluster<br/>+ DSCInitialization CRs
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 220)
        Note over HookJob,Authorino: Flow 3: Authorino TLS Bootstrap (XKS)
        HookJob->>CertMgr: Get CA secret (rhai-ca)<br/>from cert-manager namespace
        CertMgr-->>HookJob: CA certificate bundle
        HookJob->>K8sAPI: Create rhai-ca-bundle<br/>ConfigMap in app namespace
        HookJob->>Authorino: Patch Deployment:<br/>mount CA bundle,<br/>set SSL_CERT_FILE env var
        Note over Authorino: Trusts internal CA<br/>for TLS verification
    end
